{"id":"865c7ff37947029a","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-finite-injury-verification.md","title":"Finite-Injury Verification Lemma","display":"lem-finite-injury-verification — Finite-Injury Verification Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-finite-injury-verification","aliases":["88-lem-finite-injury-verification"],"display":"lem-finite-injury-verification — Finite-Injury Verification Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-priority-method]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-finite-injury-verification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-finite-injury-verification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-finite-injury-verification — Finite-Injury Verification Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e343b0f4eb4c083\" href=\"?note=8e343b0f4eb4c083\" title=\"88-df-priority-method\">88-df-priority-method</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\">\\(R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s)\">\\((A_s)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_D\">\\(p_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_D\">\\(I_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PriorityData}\">\\(\\mathrm{PriorityData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfied}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfied}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e343b0f4eb4c083\" href=\"?note=8e343b0f4eb4c083\" title=\"88-df-priority-method\">88-df-priority-method</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>。</li>\n<li>局部义务为：若所有更高优先级要求最终停止行动，则本要求最终停止行动且在最终输出上满足。断言把该义务写成显式前件，而非从“有限损伤”中自动推出它。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite\\text{-}injury\\text{-}verification}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\n\\land R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\geq s_0\\;\\forall m&lt;n\\;\np_D(s)\\neq m+1\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\bigl(\\exists s_1\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\geq s_1\\;p_D(s)\\neq n+1\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfied}(R_n,\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite\\text{-}injury\\text{-}verification}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\n\\land R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\geq s_0\\;\\forall m&lt;n\\;\np_D(s)\\neq m+1\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\bigl(\\exists s_1\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\geq s_1\\;p_D(s)\\neq n+1\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfied}(R_n,\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 作普通归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 没有更高优先级要求，局部义务的前件自动成立。归纳步中只有有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&lt;n\">\\(m&lt;n\\)</span>，取它们停止行动阶段的最大值，即满足第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个局部义务的前件。因此每个要求最终停止行动并满足，且每个要求只在有限多个更高优先级行动阶段被初始化，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>输出是可计算有限集列的单调并；在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上逐阶段寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A_s\">\\(x\\in A_s\\)</span>，找到就停机，故它是部分可计算函数的定义域，即 c.e. 集。证明中没有把局部成功义务隐藏到一个未定义的策略谓词里。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-priority-method","status":"resolved","id":"8e343b0f4eb4c083","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-priority-method]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-priority-method","status":"resolved","id":"8e343b0f4eb4c083","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$、$(A_s)$、$D$、$p_D$、$I_D$、$\\mathrm{PriorityData}$、$\\mathrm{Satisfied}$、$\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}$ 见 [[88-df-priority-method]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))","display":false},{"tex":"(A_s)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"p_D","display":false},{"tex":"I_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PriorityData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfied}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite\\text{-}injury\\text{-}verification}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\n\\land R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\geq s_0\\;\\forall m<n\\;\np_D(s)\\neq m+1\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\n\\bigl(\\exists s_1\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\geq s_1\\;p_D(s)\\neq n+1\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfied}(R_n,\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\n\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"m<n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A_s","display":false}],"bytes":2066,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e343b0f4eb4c083","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$R_n$ 可以描述最终集合的非可判定性质；不要求能在有限阶段判定最终要求是否满足。成功条件在极限输出 $\\bigcup_s A_s$ 上检验，**不**把“所有足够晚的有限 $A_s$ 满足要求”错误地当作最终满足。有限损伤本身只限制初始化次数，不能推出所有要求成功；验证这些局部义务的一个精确引理见 [[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]。"},{"id":"32064e6d9e6f371a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限损伤运行与验证义务分别见 [[88-df-priority-method]]、[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]；合并双输出时使用 [[88-df-effective-join]] 的 $A\\oplus B$。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness.md]]\n[[88-lem-countable-syntax.md]]\n[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification.md]]\n[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence.md]]\n[[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization.md]]\n[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8e343b0f4eb4c083","b283fc95a9b1376d"]}